      "narration_text": "Twenty-two lines, written by me before the second run. Two functions — hash and verify — no third. Five invariants: empty raises, no plaintext, PBKDF2 with SHA-256, at least a hundred thousand iterations, salt from secrets, constant-time compare. One boundary — touch auth.py only, standard library only. And a handoff — python -m unittest test_auth.py reports OK. Nineteen sentences that decide what Claude may fill in, and what it may not.",
